{"seq":3,"slug":"utility-ai","title":"效用系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/behavior-patterns/utility-ai","wordCount":896,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"效用系统\">效用系统</h1><p>效用系统（Utility AI）是一种基于<strong>评分权衡</strong>的 AI 决策框架，由 Dave Mark 和 Kevin Dill 在 GDC 演讲中系统阐述后被广泛采用。与 FSM 的离散状态切换和行为树的层次逻辑不同，效用系统让 AI 持续评估所有可能行为的「吸引力分数」，选择得分最高的行为执行，天然产生流畅、拟真的行为权衡。</p>\n<p>The Sims、模拟类游戏、以及 F1 比赛中的赛车 AI 策略系统都有效用系统的身影。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>效用系统的核心思想：<strong>每种可能的行为都有一个效用值（Utility），效用值越高越优先执行</strong>。效用值由一组**考量（Consideration）<strong>综合计算得出，每个考量用</strong>响应曲线（Response Curve）**将输入数据映射为 0-1 之间的分数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[世界数据\\n饥饿=0.8\\n威胁=0.2] --&gt; B[考量1\\n饥饿曲线]&#10;    A --&gt; C[考量2\\n威胁曲线]&#10;    B --&gt; D[分数 0.9]&#10;    C --&gt; E[分数 0.3]&#10;    D --&gt; F[合并计算]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[行为效用值 0.27]&#10;    G --&gt; H{选择最高分行为}\">graph LR\n    A[世界数据\\n饥饿=0.8\\n威胁=0.2] --&gt; B[考量1\\n饥饿曲线]\n    A --&gt; C[考量2\\n威胁曲线]\n    B --&gt; D[分数 0.9]\n    C --&gt; E[分数 0.3]\n    D --&gt; F[合并计算]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[行为效用值 0.27]\n    G --&gt; H{选择最高分行为}</pre><h2 id=\"响应曲线类型\">响应曲线类型</h2><p>响应曲线是效用系统的核心设计工具，将原始数据（0-1 归一化后）映射为效用分数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线类型</th>\n<th>形状</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性（Linear）</td>\n<td>直线 y=x</td>\n<td>输入与输出成正比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数（Exponential）</td>\n<td>y=x^n</td>\n<td>阈值前变化小，超阈值急剧上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对数（Logarithmic）</td>\n<td>y=log(x)</td>\n<td>早期效果显著，后期边际效益递减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S 形（Logistic/Sigmoid）</td>\n<td>S 曲线</td>\n<td>极端值效用低，中间值效用高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯（Step）</td>\n<td>阶梯函数</td>\n<td>硬阈值，越过就切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抛物线（Polynomial）</td>\n<td>二次曲线</td>\n<td>最优值在中间某点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public abstract class ResponseCurve&#10;{&#10;    public abstract float Evaluate(float normalizedInput);&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class LinearCurve : ResponseCurve&#10;{&#10;    private float slope;&#10;    private float intercept;&#10;&#10;    public LinearCurve(float slope = 1f, float intercept = 0f)&#10;    {&#10;        this.slope = slope;&#10;        this.intercept = intercept;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override float Evaluate(float x)&#10;        =&gt; Mathf.Clamp01(slope * x + intercept);&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class ExponentialCurve : ResponseCurve&#10;{&#10;    private float exponent;&#10;    private float slope;&#10;&#10;    public ExponentialCurve(float exponent = 2f, float slope = 1f)&#10;    {&#10;        this.exponent = exponent;&#10;        this.slope = slope;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override float Evaluate(float x)&#10;        =&gt; Mathf.Clamp01(slope * Mathf.Pow(x, exponent));&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class LogisticCurve : ResponseCurve&#10;{&#10;    private float steepness;&#10;    private float midpoint;&#10;&#10;    public LogisticCurve(float steepness = 10f, float midpoint = 0.5f)&#10;    {&#10;        this.steepness = steepness;&#10;        this.midpoint = midpoint;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override float Evaluate(float x)&#10;    {&#10;        float val = 1f / (1f + Mathf.Exp(-steepness * (x - midpoint)));&#10;        return Mathf.Clamp01(val);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public abstract class ResponseCurve</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public abstract float Evaluate(float normalizedInput);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class LinearCurve : ResponseCurve</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float slope;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float intercept;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public LinearCurve(float slope = 1f, float intercept = 0f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.slope = slope;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.intercept = intercept;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override float Evaluate(float x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => Mathf.Clamp01(slope * x + intercept);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ExponentialCurve : ResponseCurve</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float exponent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float slope;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public ExponentialCurve(float exponent = 2f, float slope = 1f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.exponent = exponent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.slope = slope;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override float Evaluate(float x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => Mathf.Clamp01(slope * Mathf.Pow(x, exponent));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class LogisticCurve : ResponseCurve</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float steepness;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float midpoint;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public LogisticCurve(float steepness = 10f, float midpoint = 0.5f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.steepness = steepness;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.midpoint = midpoint;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override float Evaluate(float x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float val = 1f / (1f + Mathf.Exp(-steepness * (x - midpoint)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Mathf.Clamp01(val);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"考量的构建\">考量的构建</h2><p>一个**考量（Consideration）**封装了一个影响因素的评分逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class Consideration&#10;{&#10;    public string Name { get; private set; }&#10;    private Func&lt;AIAgent, float&gt; inputFunction;   // 从 Agent 获取原始输入&#10;    private float inputMin;                        // 归一化范围&#10;    private float inputMax;&#10;    private ResponseCurve curve;                   // 响应曲线&#10;&#10;    public Consideration(&#10;        string name,&#10;        Func&lt;AIAgent, float&gt; inputFunc,&#10;        float inputMin, float inputMax,&#10;        ResponseCurve curve)&#10;    {&#10;        Name = name;&#10;        inputFunction = inputFunc;&#10;        this.inputMin = inputMin;&#10;        this.inputMax = inputMax;&#10;        this.curve = curve;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public float Score(AIAgent agent)&#10;    {&#10;        // 获取原始值并归一化到 0-1&#10;        float rawValue = inputFunction(agent);&#10;        float normalized = Mathf.InverseLerp(inputMin, inputMax, rawValue);&#10;&#10;        // 经过响应曲线映射&#10;        return curve.Evaluate(normalized);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class Consideration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public string Name { get; private set; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Func&#x3C;AIAgent, float> inputFunction;   // 从 Agent 获取原始输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float inputMin;                        // 归一化范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float inputMax;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private ResponseCurve curve;                   // 响应曲线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Consideration(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        string name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Func&#x3C;AIAgent, float> inputFunc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float inputMin, float inputMax,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ResponseCurve curve)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Name = name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        inputFunction = inputFunc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.inputMin = inputMin;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.inputMax = inputMax;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.curve = curve;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float Score(AIAgent agent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 获取原始值并归一化到 0-1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float rawValue = inputFunction(agent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float normalized = Mathf.InverseLerp(inputMin, inputMax, rawValue);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 经过响应曲线映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return curve.Evaluate(normalized);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例考量集合</strong>（进食行为）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"var eatConsiderations = new List&lt;Consideration&gt;&#10;{&#10;    // 饥饿度考量：越饥饿效用越高（指数曲线，饥饿超过0.7才急剧上升）&#10;    new Consideration(&quot;Hunger&quot;,&#10;        agent =&gt; agent.Stats.Hunger,&#10;        0f, 1f,&#10;        new ExponentialCurve(exponent: 3f)),&#10;&#10;    // 威胁考量：附近有威胁时，吃东西效用降低（取反）&#10;    new Consideration(&quot;NotThreatened&quot;,&#10;        agent =&gt; 1f - agent.Perception.ThreatLevel,&#10;        0f, 1f,&#10;        new LogisticCurve(steepness: 8f, midpoint: 0.6f)),&#10;&#10;    // 食物可用性：附近有食物才有效用&#10;    new Consideration(&quot;FoodAvailable&quot;,&#10;        agent =&gt; agent.Perception.NearestFoodDistance &gt; 20f ? 0f : 1f,&#10;        0f, 1f,&#10;        new LinearCurve())&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>var eatConsiderations = new List&#x3C;Consideration></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 饥饿度考量：越饥饿效用越高（指数曲线，饥饿超过0.7才急剧上升）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    new Consideration(\"Hunger\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        agent => agent.Stats.Hunger,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        0f, 1f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        new ExponentialCurve(exponent: 3f)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 威胁考量：附近有威胁时，吃东西效用降低（取反）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    new Consideration(\"NotThreatened\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        agent => 1f - agent.Perception.ThreatLevel,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        0f, 1f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        new LogisticCurve(steepness: 8f, midpoint: 0.6f)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 食物可用性：附近有食物才有效用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    new Consideration(\"FoodAvailable\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        agent => agent.Perception.NearestFoodDistance > 20f ? 0f : 1f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        0f, 1f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        new LinearCurve())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多考量合并\">多考量合并</h2><p>多个考量的分数如何合并为最终效用值，有几种方案：</p>\n<p><strong>乘积方案（推荐）</strong>：所有分数相乘。任一考量分数为 0 则整体为 0，体现「所有条件必须同时满足才有意义」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public float ComputeUtility(AIAgent agent)&#10;{&#10;    if (considerations.Count == 0) return 0f;&#10;&#10;    float score = 1f;&#10;    foreach (var consideration in considerations)&#10;    {&#10;        float s = consideration.Score(agent);&#10;        score *= s;&#10;        if (score &lt;= 0f) return 0f; // 早退出优化&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 修正因子：避免多个考量相乘导致分数普遍偏低&#10;    // Dave Mark 的&quot;补偿因子&quot;：1 - (1 - score)^(1/n)&#10;    float compensationFactor = 1f - (1f / considerations.Count);&#10;    float modifiedScore = score + (score * compensationFactor * (1f - score));&#10;&#10;    return Mathf.Clamp01(modifiedScore);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public float ComputeUtility(AIAgent agent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (considerations.Count == 0) return 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float score = 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    foreach (var consideration in considerations)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float s = consideration.Score(agent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        score *= s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (score &#x3C;= 0f) return 0f; // 早退出优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 修正因子：避免多个考量相乘导致分数普遍偏低</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // Dave Mark 的\"补偿因子\"：1 - (1 - score)^(1/n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float compensationFactor = 1f - (1f / considerations.Count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float modifiedScore = score + (score * compensationFactor * (1f - score));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return Mathf.Clamp01(modifiedScore);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>加权求和方案</strong>：每个考量乘以权重后求和，适合「贡献可以相互补偿」的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public float ComputeWeightedSum(AIAgent agent)&#10;{&#10;    float totalWeight = considerations.Sum(c =&gt; c.Weight);&#10;    if (totalWeight &lt;= 0f) return 0f;&#10;&#10;    float score = 0f;&#10;    foreach (var c in considerations)&#10;        score += c.Score(agent) * (c.Weight / totalWeight);&#10;&#10;    return Mathf.Clamp01(score);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public float ComputeWeightedSum(AIAgent agent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float totalWeight = considerations.Sum(c => c.Weight);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (totalWeight &#x3C;= 0f) return 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float score = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    foreach (var c in considerations)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        score += c.Score(agent) * (c.Weight / totalWeight);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return Mathf.Clamp01(score);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"行为选择\">行为选择</h2><p>效用系统在每帧（或每隔几帧）对所有可用行为打分，选择最高分的行为执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class UtilityAIAgent : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private List&lt;UtilityBehavior&gt; behaviors;&#10;    private UtilityBehavior currentBehavior;&#10;    private float evaluationInterval = 0.1f; // 每 0.1 秒评估一次&#10;    private float nextEvaluationTime;&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        if (Time.time &gt;= nextEvaluationTime)&#10;        {&#10;            EvaluateAndSelectBehavior();&#10;            nextEvaluationTime = Time.time + evaluationInterval;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        currentBehavior?.Update(this);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void EvaluateAndSelectBehavior()&#10;    {&#10;        UtilityBehavior bestBehavior = null;&#10;        float bestScore = float.MinValue;&#10;&#10;        foreach (var behavior in behaviors)&#10;        {&#10;            if (!behavior.IsContextuallyValid(this)) continue;&#10;&#10;            float score = behavior.ComputeUtility(this);&#10;&#10;            // 滞后机制：当前行为有额外加分，避免频繁切换&#10;            if (behavior == currentBehavior)&#10;                score *= 1.1f; // 10% 滞后加成&#10;&#10;            if (score &gt; bestScore)&#10;            {&#10;                bestScore = score;&#10;                bestBehavior = behavior;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        if (bestBehavior != currentBehavior)&#10;        {&#10;            currentBehavior?.OnExit(this);&#10;            currentBehavior = bestBehavior;&#10;            currentBehavior?.OnEnter(this);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class UtilityAIAgent : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private List&#x3C;UtilityBehavior> behaviors;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private UtilityBehavior currentBehavior;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float evaluationInterval = 0.1f; // 每 0.1 秒评估一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float nextEvaluationTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Time.time >= nextEvaluationTime)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            EvaluateAndSelectBehavior();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            nextEvaluationTime = Time.time + evaluationInterval;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentBehavior?.Update(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void EvaluateAndSelectBehavior()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UtilityBehavior bestBehavior = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float bestScore = float.MinValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var behavior in behaviors)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (!behavior.IsContextuallyValid(this)) continue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            float score = behavior.ComputeUtility(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 滞后机制：当前行为有额外加分，避免频繁切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (behavior == currentBehavior)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                score *= 1.1f; // 10% 滞后加成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (score > bestScore)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                bestScore = score;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                bestBehavior = behavior;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (bestBehavior != currentBehavior)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentBehavior?.OnExit(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentBehavior = bestBehavior;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentBehavior?.OnEnter(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"滞后与噪声防抖\">滞后与噪声防抖</h2><p>效用系统的一个常见问题是<strong>行为抖动（Thrashing）</strong>——两个行为的效用分数非常接近时，AI 可能在两者间快速来回切换。解决方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 方案一：当前行为滞后加成（见上文，10% bonus）&#10;&#10;// 方案二：添加噪声，让评分更自然（类似人类决策的随机性）&#10;float score = behavior.ComputeUtility(this);&#10;score += Random.Range(-0.05f, 0.05f); // ±5% 随机扰动&#10;&#10;// 方案三：最低切换间隔（状态保持时间限制）&#10;if (Time.time - lastBehaviorChangeTime &lt; minBehaviorDuration)&#10;    return; // 不切换\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 方案一：当前行为滞后加成（见上文，10% bonus）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方案二：添加噪声，让评分更自然（类似人类决策的随机性）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float score = behavior.ComputeUtility(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>score += Random.Range(-0.05f, 0.05f); // ±5% 随机扰动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 方案三：最低切换间隔（状态保持时间限制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (Time.time - lastBehaviorChangeTime &#x3C; minBehaviorDuration)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return; // 不切换</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"效用系统-vs-fsm-vs-行为树\">效用系统 vs FSM vs 行为树</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>FSM</th>\n<th>行为树</th>\n<th>效用系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行为表达</td>\n<td>离散状态</td>\n<td>层次逻辑树</td>\n<td>连续评分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设计方式</td>\n<td>画状态图</td>\n<td>连节点</td>\n<td>设计曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为可预测性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（更「自然」）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调参方式</td>\n<td>改转换条件</td>\n<td>改优先级/节点</td>\n<td>调曲线参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合受众</td>\n<td>程序员</td>\n<td>程序员+设计师</td>\n<td>设计师驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>简单 NPC、控制器</td>\n<td>复杂 NPC 行为序列</td>\n<td>模拟类游戏、社会 AI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>效用系统通过考量 + 响应曲线 + 评分合并，将 AI 决策建模为持续的分数权衡过程。它自然地产生流畅的行为过渡（饥饿慢慢升高时，进食欲望也慢慢增加），而不是 FSM 那样的突然切换。核心技能是设计合适的响应曲线和调整权重，使 AI 产生既「理智」又「自然」的行为。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"behavior-trees\">行为树</a> — 层次化的行为序列，与效用系统常组合使用</li>\n<li><a href=\"goap-planning\">目标导向行动规划</a> — 自动规划行动序列，适合动态适应环境的 AI</li>\n<li><a href=\"../fundamentals/state-machine-implementation\">状态机实现策略</a> — 效用系统的执行层可用协程式状态机实现，兼顾时序和评分</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"效用系统","id":"效用系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"响应曲线类型","id":"响应曲线类型"},{"level":2,"text":"考量的构建","id":"考量的构建"},{"level":2,"text":"多考量合并","id":"多考量合并"},{"level":2,"text":"行为选择","id":"行为选择"},{"level":2,"text":"滞后与噪声防抖","id":"滞后与噪声防抖"},{"level":2,"text":"效用系统 vs FSM vs 行为树","id":"效用系统-vs-fsm-vs-行为树"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"目标导向行动规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/behavior-patterns/goap-planning"},"next":{"title":"角色控制器状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/game-applications/character-controller-states"}}